📚 SRE Concepts

SLA (Service Level Agreement) – Formal agreement on uptime/availability.
SLO (Service Level Objective) – Target level of reliability (e.g., 99.9% uptime).
SLI (Service Level Indicator) – Metrics to track service health (e.g., latency, error rate).

Error Budget – Acceptable threshold of failure before slowing releases.
